{"slug":"596891-somavaaranaa","title":"ಸೋಮವಾರನಾ?","titleEn":"Somavaaranaa","level":"3","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":547},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/596891-somavaaranaa","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":596891,"authors":["Shabnam  Minwalla"],"illustrators":["Upasana Mehndiratta"],"translators":["Hoor Banu"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2021","originalStory":{"title":"On Mondays I Want to Hide"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Soomavaaranaa’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org. This book was translated by teachers of Sri Saradadevi Vidya Kendra, Shivanahalli as part of the voluntary translation drive on 20/08/22.","attributionLine":"ಸೋಮವಾರನಾ? (Kannada), translated by Hoor Banu, based on original story On Mondays I Want to Hide, written by Shabnam  Minwalla, illustrated by Upasana Mehndiratta, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2021) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"An angry man with a moustache shouting","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Upasana Mehndiratta","year":"2021"},{"page":3,"title":"Children running in the playground","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":4,"title":"A lady drinking tea and talking","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":5,"title":"A sleepy girl","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":6,"title":"A girl in her school uniform","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"A girl checking her bag","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"A kid with very long legs","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"A kid riding a bicycle","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"A happy girl","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"A girl waving her hand","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Two kids lying on a mat","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":13,"title":"An old man listening to music","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":14,"title":"A girl near a fan","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":15,"title":"A girl day dreaming","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಸೋಮವಾರ ಅಕಸ್ಮಾತ್‌ ಒಬ್ಬ ಮನುಷ್ಯ ಆಗಿದ್ರೆ,","ಖಂಡಿತ ಅದು ಕಂಬಳಿ ಹುಳು ತರಹದ ಹುಬ್ಬು ಇರುವ,","ಗಂಟೆ ಹೊಡೆದಂತೆ ಗಟ್ಟಿಯಾಗಿ ಮಾತನಾಡುವ,","\"ಏಳಿ! ಏಳಿ! ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡಬೇಕು,” ಅಂತ ಹೇಳುವ","ಪ್ರಿನ್ಸಿಪಾಲರೇ ಆಗಿರ್ತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಈಗ ಗೊತ್ತಾಯ್ತಾ, ಸೋಮವಾರ ಬಂದರೆ ನನಗೆ ಯಾಕೆ ಬಚ್ಚಿಟ್ಟುಕೊಳ್ಳಬೇಕು ಅಂತ ಅನ್ನಿಸುತ್ತೆ?"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮಂಗಳವಾರವೇನಾದರೂ ಹೆಂಗಸಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅದು ಬೂದು ಬಣ್ಣದ ಸೀರೆ ಉಟ್ಟ,","ಪ್ರತಿವಾರ ತಪ್ಪದೇ ಬಂದು,","ಚಹಾ ಕುಡಿದು ಹರಟೆ ಹೊಡೆಯುವ","ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಆಗಿರುತ್ತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾವು ಆಕಳಿಸುತ್ತಾ, ಆಚೆ ಯಾವಾಗ ಹೋಗ್ತಾರಪ್ಪಾ ಅಂತ ಕಾಯ್ತಾ ಕೂತಿರುತ್ತಿದ್ವಿ. ಹೊರಡುವುದನ್ನೇ ಕಾಯುತ್ತಿದ್ದೆವು. ಮಂಗಳವಾರ ನನಗಂತೂ ಹೊತ್ತೇ ಹೋಗಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬುಧವಾರವೇನಾದರೂ ಹುಡುಗಿಯಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅವಳು, ನೇರಳೆ ಬಣ್ಣದ ಕನ್ನಡಕ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಿದ್ದಳು.","ಇಸ್ತ್ರಿ ಮಾಡಿದ ಗರಿಗರಿ ಯುನಿಫಾರಂ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಂಡು","ಮೂರು ಮೂರು ಪೆನ್ಸಿಲ್ ಹೆರೆದು ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಂಡಿರುತ್ತಿದ್ದಳು.","ಲೆಕ್ಕ ಬಿಡಿಸಿ, ಹಾಲು ಕುಡಿದು,","ತನ್ನ ಸ್ಕೂಲ್‌ ಬ್ಯಾಗ್‌ ತಾನೇ ಜೋಡಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಿದ್ದಳು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬುಧವಾರ ಬಿಡುವಿಲ್ಲದ ದಿನ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಗುರುವಾರವೇನಾದರೂ ಹುಡುಗ ಆಗಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅವನು ಹಳದಿ ಟಿ-ಶರ್ಟ್‌ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಳ್ತಿದ್ದ...","ತಲೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಚೇಷ್ಟೆ ಮತ್ತು ಚಾಕೋಲೇಟ್‌ ಅಷ್ಟೇ ಇರ್ತಿತ್ತು.","ಯಾವಾಗ ನೋಡಿದರೂ ಕುಣಿತಿದ್ದ, ಕುಪ್ಪಳಿಸುತ್ತಿದ್ದ, ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಿದ್ದ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಗುರುವಾರದ ದಿನ ನಂದೊಂದೇ ಪ್ಲಾನ್‌ - ಖುಷಿಯಾಗಿರುವುದು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಶುಕ್ರವಾರವೇನಾದರೂ ನನ್ನ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಅಕ್ಕ ಆಗಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅವಳು ಗೆಳತಿಯರನ್ನು ಕಾಣಲು ಸಜ್ಜಾಗುತ್ತಿದ್ದಳು.","ಗಲಗಲ ಅಂತ ನಗುತ್ತಾ ಮಜವಾಗಿರುತ್ತಿದ್ದಳು..","ಕಿವಿಗೆ ನಕ್ಷತ್ರದ ಓಲೆ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಿದ್ದಳು. ನಕ್ಷತ್ರ ಅವಳ ಕಣ್ಣಲ್ಲಿ ಮಿಣ ಮಿಣ ಅಂತ ಮಿನುಗ್ತಾ ಇರ್ತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ವಾರದಲ್ಲಿ ಎಲ್ಲ ದಿನಾನೂ ಶುಕ್ರವಾರ ಆಗಬಾರದೇಕೆ!"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಶನಿವಾರಕ್ಕೇನಾದರೂ ಮಿಂಚಿನಂತಹ ನಗುವಿದ್ದಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅದು ನನ್ನ ಬೆಸ್ಟ್‌ ಫ್ರೆಂಡ್ ಆಗಿರುತ್ತಿತ್ತು.","ನಾವಿಬ್ಬರೂ ಕುಂಟೆಬಿಲ್ಲೆ ಆಡ್ತಾ ಇದ್ವಿ.","ಒಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಪುಸ್ತಕ ಓದ್ತಾ ಇದ್ವಿ.","ಒಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಕೂತ್ಕೊಂಡು ಮಳೆ ಹುಯ್ಯೋದು ನೋಡ್ತಾ ಇದ್ವಿ.","ಶನಿವಾರ ಮುಗಿಯದೇ ಇದ್ದರೆ ಎಷ್ಟು ಚಂದ ಅಂತ ನನಗೆ ಯಾವಾಗ್ಲೂ ಅನ್ನಿಸುತ್ತೆ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಭಾನುವಾರ ಬೋಳು ತಲೆಯ ಅಜ್ಜನಾಗಿದ್ದಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅದು ತಿಂದುಂಡು, ಮಲಗಿ ಕಥೆ ಹೇಳುತ್ತಿತ್ತು.","ಅಜ್ಜ ಯಾವಾಗ್ಲೂ ಮುಂಜಾನೆ ಖುಷಿ, ಖುಷಿಯಾಗೇ ಇರ್ತಾ ಇದ್ದರು. ಆದರೆ, ಸಂಜೆ ಬಹಳ ಬೇಸರದಲ್ಲಿ ಇರ್ತಾ ಇದ್ದರು."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಭಾನುವಾರದಂದು ನಾನು ತಲೆ ಸ್ನಾನ ಮಾಡುತ್ತೇನೆ.","ಮತ್ತು ಸೋಮವಾರದ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ಯೋಚಿಸದೇ ಇರೋಣ ಎಂದುಕೊಳ್ಳುವೆ."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/596891-somavaaranaa/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಸೋಮವಾರ","ಮಂಗಳವಾರ","ಬುಧವಾರ","ಗುರು ವಾರ","ಶುಕ್ರವಾರ","ಶನಿವಾರ","ಭಾನುವಾರ","ವಾರದಲ್ಲಿ ನಿನಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟದ ದಿನ ಯಾವುದು?"]}],"wordCount":225}